WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions describe the on-screen content of a silent-by-default screen
recording of the Elmtrackr app. The clip has a background audio track (not
spoken narration); the meaningful information is the on-screen interface.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
A calendar page settles on "July 24".

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.500
