00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:51.000
The Reports screen: a monthly view with Hours and Travel-refund tabs, a regular / overtime / weekend breakdown, CSV and PDF export, and gross pay before tax plus travel refunds.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.500
A clock-out card: a live shift timer (8:24:17, since 08:02) with a "Clock out" button.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:01.000
A monthly summary card: gross pay, total hours, shift count and refunds.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:05.000
The ElmTrackr logo and the tagline "Your work. Your record."
